## Use Cases

### Gaming Companies

Mobile game developers use Kochava to optimize user acquisition across ad networks, measure player lifetime value (LTV), and attribute in-app purchases and ad revenue to specific marketing campaigns. Gaming clients benefit from real-time fraud prevention, automated playable ad optimization, and ML-driven Day-7 LTV forecasting. Example: A leading mobile game reduced CAC by 35% and increased D7 ROAS by 50% using Kochava's fraud prevention and creative optimization.

### Fintech & Financial Services

Banking apps, investment platforms, and crypto exchanges use Kochava to measure user acquisition across expensive, competitive channels while maintaining strict compliance (SOC 2 Type II). Kochava connects cross-device journeys (mobile research to desktop account funding) and measures high-intent deposit attribution. Example: A digital banking app identified that CTV campaigns drove 3x higher deposit amounts than mobile display campaigns, leading to a 40% budget reallocation toward CTV with 25% improvement in acquisition ROI.

### Retail & eCommerce

Shopping and delivery apps use Kochava to attribute installs and purchases, optimize cart abandonment re-engagement, and measure omnichannel journeys (online browsing to in-store purchases via location data). Kochava SmartLinks with dynamic macros and rich previews power seamless web-to-app routing. Example: A QSR app used Kochava SmartLinks with QR codes in TV commercials, attributing 15,000 new app installs directly to offline media.

### Media & Entertainment

Streaming services, news platforms, and podcast networks use Kochava to measure subscriber acquisition costs, optimize content promotion campaigns, and attribute subscriptions across smart TVs, streaming devices, and mobile. Example: A streaming service discovered that branded content partnerships drove 2.5x higher subscription trial-to-paid conversion rates than generic display ads.

### Travel & Hospitality

Airlines, hotels, and booking services use Kochava's multi-touch attribution to credit all touchpoints across long 10-15 touchpoint consideration journeys. Example: An airline discovered email campaigns were being under-credited in last-touch models; reallocating 20% more budget to email increased overall booking revenue by 12%.

